00:08:06.000 --> 00:09:07.000
It appeared as though a struggle had taken place right outside Kathleen's clinic. Blood was splattered onto some foliage near the door and the rubber door mat was also heavily bloodstained. But there were no bloody shoe prints leading to or from the area. More police were summoned to the house and just as they were about to begin a thorough examination of the property's exterior, an automatic sprinkler activated, washing away possible evidence from the driveway and surrounds. The clinic below Kathleen's home had two access points, the frosted glass door which acted as its entry and a sliding glass door at its rear. There was no internal access point from the upstairs residence and the frosted glass door was sealed shut. As an officer circled the property, they came across a small window in the garage that looked into the clinic.
看起来在凯瑟琳诊所外发生了一场搏斗。门附近的树叶上溅有血迹，橡胶门垫上也沾满了血迹。但该区域周围没有通往或离开的血脚印。更多的警察被召集到房子里，就在他们准备开始对房产外部进行彻底检查时，一个自动喷水装置启动了，冲走了车道和周围可能存在的证据。凯瑟琳家下方的诊所有两个入口，一个是作为入口的磨砂玻璃门，另一个是后部的滑动玻璃门。楼上的住宅没有内部入口，磨砂玻璃门被封死了。当一名警官绕着房产巡视时，他们发现车库里有一扇小窗户可以看到诊所内部。

