It appeared the altercation that had started outside the clinic had continued indoors, with defence wounds indicating that Kathleen had put up a fight. A white bucket underneath the sink contained bloody water, a dishcloth, Kathleen's glasses and one running shoe. The matching shoe sat next to the bucket. There were also droplets of watered down blood on a plastic bag next to the sink. It looked as though the killer had tried to clean themselves and the crime scene before fleeing. A collapsed cardboard box was propped against the wall beneath the broken window depicting their exit route. It too had blood on it, leading investigators to wonder if the killer had injured themselves during the attack. A total of 26 swabs were taken throughout the space in the hope that they had left their DNA at the scene.
看起来在诊所外开始的争执一直持续到了室内，防御性伤口表明凯瑟琳进行了反抗。水槽下的一个白色水桶里装有血水、一块抹布、凯瑟琳的眼镜和一只跑鞋。另一只配套的鞋子放在水桶旁边。水槽旁的一个塑料袋上也有稀释的血滴。看起来凶手在逃跑前试图清理自己和犯罪现场。破碎窗户下方的墙边靠着一个压扁的纸板箱，描绘了他们的逃跑路线。上面也有血迹，这让调查人员怀疑凶手在袭击过程中是否受了伤。整个空间总共采集了26个拭子，希望他们能在现场留下DNA。

